	["The Dark Iron dwarves' capital deep in Blackrock Mountain, ruled by Emperor Dagran Thaurissan in the shadow of the Firelord."] = "A capital dos anões Ferro Negro, nas profundezas da Montanha Rocha Negra, governada pelo Imperador Dagran Thaurissan à sombra do Senhor do Fogo.",
